{
  "batch_id": "s1:batch:0015",
  "translations": [
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01101",
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01104",
      "en": "Hmm, having that many servants...",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01105",
      "en": "Celica, are you perhaps nobility?",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01108",
      "en": "No.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01111",
      "en": "Then, who are you?",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01113",
      "en": "Without answering, I went to a table that was clearing.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01114",
      "en": "I sat at a nearby table in the dining hall.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01116",
      "en": "She thought my silence meant I would not talk.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01117",
      "en": "Rinsha silently brought a menu from the counter",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01118",
      "en": "and placed it before me.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01121",
      "en": "I guarantee the taste.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01123",
      "en": "Rinsha, beaming, puffed out her ample chest.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01124",
      "en": "She showed off her full chest even more.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01125",
      "en": "The cooking aroma filling the dining hall was",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01126",
      "en": "enough to stimulate my appetite.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01129",
      "en": "True...",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01130",
      "en": "Something light and small in portion...",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01133",
      "en": "You order like a girl... then try this.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01135",
      "en": "Rinsha's finger pointed to a dish on the menu.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01138",
      "en": "I see.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01141",
      "en": "So, Shuri...",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01144",
      "en": "She'll be here soon.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01146",
      "en": "No sooner said, Shuri came down the stairs",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01147",
      "en": "with quiet yet hurried steps.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01150",
      "en": "Oh, really...",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01152",
      "en": "Her quiet, hurried steps... when Shuri was a child,",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01153",
      "en": "she often used to run up to me,",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01154",
      "en": "so I warned her she might fall and get hurt,",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01155",
      "en": "and she's walked like this ever since.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01162",
      "en": "I'm sorry for keeping you waiting...",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01169",
      "en": "It's fine, right, Celica?",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01172",
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "notes": ""
    }
  ],
